     N'Contracting sector: standalone grade capped at Baa2 (volatile public demand, the 2016-2018 experience)')
            ) AS v (RuleCode, Stage, Notches, CapGrade, ParamValue, ShowWhen, NameAr, TextAr, TextEn)
